window.products.push({"id":538045,"name":"Towel Warmer Bucket, Hot Towel Warmers with Auto Keep Warm, Heat Timer 20/40/60 Min Adjustable and Up to 24 Hour Delay Timer, Large Towel Warmer for O","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wsiYj7OPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Pamper Your Friends & Family With This Incredible Present! ✅✅✅【Luxurious Towel Warmer】The DOACE Towel Warmer is one of the best household care products, whether you're looking for a warm, fluffy towel post-shower or you want to create a spa-like atmosphere right in your home, a towel warmer is worth deserving for everyone. Also, this is the best Father's and Mother's Day gift idea for family. ✅✅✅【Adjustable heating & Delaying Timer】The hot towel warmer offers rapid heat up in just 1 minute and reach high temperature in just 6 minutes. The towel warmer bucket is set in up to 24-hour delay timer and auto keep warm for 20/ 40/ 60 minutes, according to your own demands to adjust it, whether you're taking a quick shower or long, relaxing soak, the warmer suits all your need, use it with more confidence! ✅✅✅【The Largest Capacity & Special Hooks】25L Ultra large Bucket towel warmers for bathroom, accommodates up to two 40\" X 70\" oversized bath towels, bathrobes, blankets, PJ's. With 4 hooks attached, you can hang some small fabrics and take them out easily, such as underwear, socks, T-shirts, vests, headscarves and more. Note: If you heat some oversize fabrics, please remove the hooks. ✅✅✅【Flip-Top Lid & Customized Fragrance】The towel warmer bucket is user friendly with digital LED display and smart control touch panel so your heating could be set by simply pressing a button. Features a fragrance disc holder, customize your own favorite flavor. With the attached lid and unique design for hiding charger cable, keep your home stylish and tidy. ✅✅✅【A Warm and Sweet Gift】This versatile Bucket towel warmer makes it a well thought out gift for housewarming, wedding, shower or birthday, anniversary and more occasions. Perfect Accessory for Home, Pool House, Shower, Salon, Hotel, Spa, Massage, Baby Care, Elders and people getting bed bath & More. Once you have experienced the comfort of a warm towel, that will become your daily pleasant surprise after a bath. Pamper your friends & family with this incredible present!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wsiYj7OPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DOACE","source_asin":"B09QM5JQNN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-538045","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QM5JQNN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QM5JQNN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
