window.products.push({"id":538082,"name":"Emsco 1519 Replacement Tree Stand for Artificial Trees","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/417vwOPEW3L._AC_.jpg","description":"The quick stands artificial tree stand is the easiest replacement tree stand for your holiday festivities. The easy-to-use speed nut design allow you to quickly prop up your tree without sitting there, holding the tree for countless Min as you turn long traditional screws. The quick stands Christmas tree stands use a speed nut that quickly positions the locking pins, allowing you to set them with a couple quick turns for an incredibly stable lock. The base is made from heavy-duty polyethylene that's safe & devoid of any harmful chemicals. Designed specifically for artificial trees, This tree stand Fits 1-3\" Diameters. The base diameter is 19 1/2\" Base. All quick stand tree stands are made in the USA by Ensco Group.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/417vwOPEW3L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Emsco Group","source_asin":"B00IPUGOMK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-538082","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00IPUGOMK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00IPUGOMK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":538083,"name":"Rachael Ray Moppine Towel - 2-in-1 Kitchen Towel and Pot Holder with 2 Heat Resistant Pockets to Grip Hot Cookware, Bakeware - Absorbent Kitchen Towel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pNee5pLXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The multi-functional Rachael Ray 2-in-1 Moppine, Ultra Absorbent Dish Towels with Heat Resistant Oven Gloves serves as Rachael Ray’s favorite 2-in-1 kitchen item. This beautifully designed combo kitchen towels and potholders is an essential tool that functions in many ways. It features two heat resistant pockets that are perfect to protect your hands when handling hot cookware sets. Moreover, the integrated pockets serve as a great way to grip your dishes while drying them. The cotton dish towels material is soft enough to absorb but durable enough to withstand repeated uses. When not in use, these kitchen hand towels will look great anywhere in your kitchen, whether they are folded on the counter, hanging from a cabinet handle, via the built in loop or on a kitchen towel bar, or kitchen towel rack. Hot pads and oven mitts are a must have and allow you to get a secure hold on your favorite Rachael Ray cookware sets, or bakeware set you are carrying, so there’s no risk of dropping your delicious pie. In addition to handling hot Rachael Ray pots and pans, they can be used for many other purposes. Grilling, tending a fire while camping, unscrewing a hot light bulb, or keeping hot dishes from burning a wooden surface such as a table, are all great times to whip out your oven mitt pot holder. They are also useful for hard-to-open jar lids. These oven mitts are comfortable, durable and easy care. Wash separately before first use with like colors. Dark colors may bleed. Machine wash cold. Gentle cycle. Use mild detergent. Do not bleach. Tumble Dry low. Cool iron as needed. Measures 27 inches L x 19 inches W. A very handy tool to keep around or wonderful enough to give as a Christmas or Thanksgiving gift.for the men and women in your life than enjoy cooking and baking at home. Coordinates with Rachael Ray’s everyday line of Cookware, Pot Holders, and Trivets.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pNee5pLXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rachael Ray","source_asin":"B015T1WKFW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-538083","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B015T1WKFW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B015T1WKFW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
