window.products.push({"id":538091,"name":"Oskinm Milk Frother Handheld with 3 Stainless Steel Whisks, USB Rechargeable Electric Foam Maker, Drink Mixer with 3 Speeds for Coffee, Bulletproof Co","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YvZ-OoEaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Various Usage】: This handheld milk frother is equipped with 3 types of stainless steel whisks to meet a variety need of kitchen use scenaries like, spring whisk: it can be used to stir micro bubble food such as coffee milk, protein powder drinks and beverage, etc.; balloon whisk: designed for whipping cream and egg white; hook whisk: main for olive oil, milk powder, supplementary food, etc. 【Powerful Motor】: The hand frother is powered by an upgraded motor, this big heart helps you get the silky and creamy froth in seconds, and it also gives you a more reliable and silent performance for long last. It’s an excellent present for all coffee lovers and DIY enthusiasts. 【Multiple Speeds】: 3 gears available according to your need, you can always find an ideal whisking speed for your demand with this coffee mixer wand. The higher speed you press, the less time it will take, and more creamy foam you can get. 【Easy to Clean】: Each of whisks can be separated from the host and washed directly in the running water, which ensures your health, and there is no need to worry about the motor geting wet. Meanwhile, put the frother on the stand to avoid falling and keep your countertop tidy. 【Portable & Rechargeable】: With a built-in rechargeable battery, you can charge this electric frother anywhere by USB cable, which prevents you from the trouble of finding new battery replacements. Also all the whisks are detachable, they can be packed conveniently in one small bag, it is perfect for camp and travel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YvZ-OoEaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oskinm","source_asin":"B08QMVPCG5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-538091","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QMVPCG5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QMVPCG5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
