;
window.products.push({"id":538111,"name":"ION Graphics Funny Magnet - Funny Shocker Vinyl Magnet - Shocker Refrigerator Magnet - Funny Decal - Funny Bumper Magnet - Joke Magnet - Gag Joke Gift","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41puiAJJFeL._AC_.jpg","description":"We print stickers at 1440 dpi. That means we can easily match every color and print even the most complex designs. Even highly detailed images always come out awesome. We know that a sticker is only as good as its adhesive. Like the vinyl we use, we set out to find the best adhesive. All of our stickers have a very strong adhesive that still keeps the surface intact if it needs to be removed. We make our stickers to withstand exposure to wind, rain and sunlight. In addition to premium vinyl, the stickers are coated with a protective UV laminate that makes them super durable and resistant to fading, scratching, tearing, and water. Depending on conditions, our stickers are fade resistant for 3 to 5 years.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41puiAJJFeL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ION Graphics","source_asin":"B07GV9WMVY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-538111","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GV9WMVY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GV9WMVY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":538112,"name":"DaTerra Cucina Santoku Knife - 7 Inch | Eisenrose - Sharp German Steel - Professional Kitchen Knives","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712yBNOBcoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Ultimate Santoku Knife for Every Kitchen: Whether you're busy mincing, chopping, cutting, carving, trimming or dicing... you need a dependable tool that will last the tests of time and use. That's why we made this Santoku knife with a Kullenschliff Edge you will love using. Whether you are making a four-course meal for the in-laws, throwing a huge dinner party... or just making some chicken soup, your new Eisenrose Knife will never let you down. Design & Quality Inspired by Thousands of Years of Culinary Culture: There's not a cooking task our Santoku Knife cannot take on, in kitchen's across the world. But there isn't a culture that values their knives more than an Asian one. After discovering the ‘city of knives’—Yangjiang, China, we decided to make it our mission to bring you the utmost quality carbon blended steel... the kind of quality that makes you proud just to hold it. When Rosewood Meets Steel... it Only Gets Stronger: Especially with the way we've balanced these cooking knives for you; the polished, natural rosewood handle sits in the palm of your hand in perfect ergonomic bliss. The beauty of this premier, chopping knife handle is that it's been expertly crafted from the finest real rosewood, ensuring that every piece is an exquisitely unique complement to your kitchen. We Sourced the Best Materials on the Planet: Inspired by Asian culture and crafted from German steel; did you know that Germany makes the most durable, reliable, and sharpest steel on the planet? We went one step farther and added the Kullenschliff Edge so that your knife will be slicing for decades to come. It's also been heated in a vacuum furnace and chilled in a cryogenic deep freeze, super hardening it. From mom to professional chef; this knife was made for you. Our Promise Cuts Through All of Your Worries: Our 365 Day Manufacturer’s Warranty protects you. And you’ll feel relieved to know that we stand by all of our kitchen products; they've been tried, tested, and PROVEN to slice through the test of time. We are so confident you’ll love your new DaTerra 8 inch Santoku knife that we offer our 365 Day Money Back Guarantee. Welcome to the family! test","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712yBNOBcoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DaTerra Cucina","source_asin":"B09HHH1HTY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-538112","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HHH1HTY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HHH1HTY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":538113,"name":"Dripless Metallic Hanukkah Candles Frosted Premium Tapered Hand Decorated Chanuka Candles","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WLXXkNKyL._AC_SL1404_.jpg","description":"LIGHT UP THE NIGHT A favorite for so many, celebrating Chanuka is a highlight of the year. Of all the holiday traditions, kindling the Menorah is the main event. Lighting the candles while reciting the blessings and singing traditional hymns brings family and friends together to celebrate, young and old alike.  The Dreidel Company's variety of Chanukah candles allows you to choose a size, color and design that you love to celebrate the holiday in style. Whether you prefer a classic, standard size white, natural beeswax, fun multi-color assortments or funky themes, we have the perfect candles to put the finishing touches on your menorah and make it look spectacular.  Celebrate the Festival of Lights with plenty of candles to last you through all 8 nights, just like the miraculous oil jug in the Holy Temple. Our 45-count boxes suffice to light one menorah, including the shamash, on each night of the chag.  Stock up for the whole family!   BUY RISK-FREE: At The Dreidel Company, We fully stand behind our products with total satisfaction and 100% money-back guarantee. Not satisfied with the Dripless Hanukkah Candles?  We’ll send you a quick replacement or issue a full refund. Click ‘Add to Cart’ now to surprise your little one completely risk-free!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WLXXkNKyL._AC_SL1404_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Dreidel Company","source_asin":"B09M4BTDXM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-538113","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09M4BTDXM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09M4BTDXM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
