window.products.push({"id":538328,"name":"OMNI Cherry Maple Cutting Board | Strong & Durable Wood Cutting Board for Kitchen | Chopping Board Suitable for Meat, Vegetables, Cheese and More | Ma","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SgV4A266L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔ 【 Durable & Long-lasting 】: Our wooden cutting board is made up of strong, dense, lightweight, and the finest quality Maple wood that makes it durable enough for clean and safe chopping while soft enough not to damage knives, helping to provide you with an excellent chopping block that can be used for a longer period of time without the fear of cracking or splintering ✔ 【 Visually Stunning Finish 】: These cutting boards for kitchen have been specifically crafted to ensure an attractive and stunning appearance that helps to add an extra elegance to your kitchen and life. Moreover, their smooth and beautiful texture allows you to use them as serving platter to serve your loved ones in a more convenient, charming and stylish manner ✔ 【 Wide Usage 】: We have designed our butcher block to have a very suitable size that provides an exceptional experience whether you're cutting, dicing, mincing, or chopping. Also, with a steady and durable design, these wood cutting boards are perfect for carving meats, poultry, fish, vegetables, fruits, herbs and much more! ✔ 【 Perfect Choice as a Gift 】: Chefs, cooking fans, or anyone who enjoys equipping their kitchen with useful gadgets will love this delightful meat cutting board. You can present it as a gift to your friends, family or loved ones on any special occasion just to make their day more beautiful. Additionally, it is extremely easy to clean, since you can simply rinse it with hot water after using it ✔ 【 Exclusively Made in USA 】: Customer satisfaction is one of our top priorities that’s why we OMNI are based in the USA, we use the best possible tactics while preparing our wood cutting boards for kitchen but if you feel any inconvenience for any reason feel free to contact us, to solve your problem, our customer support will always go the extra mile","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SgV4A266L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Omni Products USA","source_asin":"B09JMC39LM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-538328","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JMC39LM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JMC39LM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":538329,"name":"Lugez \"Shooting Stars\" Ice Luge Mold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511yGQLcztL._AC_.jpg","description":"Lugez's easy mold & tubing system finally brings this luxurious & functional party novelty to you - without the incredible expense of a professional ice sculptor!  There’s a new way for you and your fellow partgoers to enjoy shots….An Ice Sculpture that IS the Dispenser! Our molds will make Ice Luge Sculpture that are beautiful and functional. Never before has there been a mold available that will create a drinkable ice sculpture.  Each Mold comes with simple instructions on how to make your Ice Luge. Please read the instructions and tips within the instructions.  Are the Ice Lugez Molds & LED lights re-usable?  The Ice Lugez molds are a one-time use. It would cost ~$300 to make a reusable Ice Luge mold with the detail we provide. So in order to keep the price down, it is not reusable. The LED lights can be used many times. And the LED light is water resistant. How long does the Ice Lugez last for? An average usage time for Lugez Ice Lugezis 2-4 hours. The usage time for your Ice Lugez is influenced by which model you choose, temperature, and how much it is used. We firmly recommend using cold liquids to maximize the lifespan of your Ice Lugez. The Ice Lugez melting is part of the party experience… so make it fun to watch the ice melt. How Big are the molds? Each Lugez Ice Lugez Mold is 12x12x8 inches. The molds hold approximately 2 gallons of water. Thus, they are big, but able to fit in a normal freezer. Can I add food coloring or objects to the Ice Lugez? Yes!!! There are many ways to customize your Ice Lugez. Food coloring is a great way to decorate the ice. Test your colors with a water bottle to insure the colors are pretty. Also, experiment with different color LED lights beneath the ice to gain the effect you desire. Contact Us Anytime you have a question an/or comment","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511yGQLcztL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lugez Ice Luge Mold","source_asin":"B002T5A7XY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-538329","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002T5A7XY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002T5A7XY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
