window.products.push({"id":538443,"name":"FUNLAX Closet Organizer, 6 Cube 12 * 12 inches Storage Shelves Bathroom Organizer Portable Closet Organization and Storage for Clothes Books Toys Yarn","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519vdlTaOvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Versatile: This cube storage organizer is divided into separate units for storage by sorting and keeping everything organized. As an opened shelf, you can see clearly what's in it and take it out in seconds without messing up other items. FUNLAX storage shelf is ideal for storing clothes, books, toys, clothes, books, toys, shoes, plushie collections, figure displays, purses, linen, plants, and other necessities in living room, bedroom, bathroom, kitchen, office, and other limited spaces. Durable: High-density solid metal frame, thick and durable PP panel, high-hardness ABS connector and internal interlocking design together constitute a stable and durable structure of the cube storage. Secure the connecting corners with the zip ties to double fasten the closet storage. You can move the cube shelf with such great stability and won't fall apart. FUNLAX high-quality organizers and storage meets your lightweight storage need for years. Easy to assemble and dissemble: The design of modular and interlocking allows a quick installation in 30mins with the help of the instructional manual. Using the hammer included will save you lots of strength. Simply disassemble the cube shelves by taking off the connectors, which is perfect for people who live in a dorm or rent a house. It’s convenient to take away when moving house. Creative: The modular and interlocking design of the plastic cube storage organizer allows multiple stacking option.You can use the cube unit seperately or design different configuration according to your space and taste.The semitransparent is able to coordinate with different home style. The utility and creativity of FUNLAX cube shelf organizer make it more than great storage solution but good decor for room, adding a Minimalistic aesthetic. Large Storage Space: The cubby storage organizer consists of 6 cubes. Each cube of the closet is 12\"*12\"*12\"(30cm*30cm*30cm), which holds at least 30 T-shirts. Each cube holds up to 10lbs (4.5kg), equates to 9 bottles of 16.9fl. oz water, which is enough for daily lightweight storage needs. Putting heavier things on the bottom while light ones on the top ensure better stability.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519vdlTaOvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FUNLAX","source_asin":"B0BR6DJ76V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-538443","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BR6DJ76V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BR6DJ76V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
