window.products.push({"id":538558,"name":"Snappy Grips -Bucket Handles -Mining-Farming-Gardening-Painting-Construction 20pc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.3,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81w3JoGj3mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SNAPPY GRIP Egonomic Replacement Bucket HandlesYou will receive 20 Snappy Grips, Snappy Grip Ergonomic Handles can be used for anything from buckets, traps and cages, ropes, bungee, or as handles on your shop made tools. You will receive 2 of each of the 10 different colors ( Or 4 1/2 Grips of each color). If your out prospecting the best way to keep track of your different samples is to have different colors on each bucket. With this set you can have 20 different bucket handles. If you mix the colors like 1/2 Green & 1/2 Black, then the next bucket 1/2 Green & 1/2 Yellow and the next bucket 1/2 Black & 1/2 Yellow and so on you can make up many different combos. Look at the 4th photo for a sample of this. Durable SNaPPY GRiP Ergonomic Handles are made to last for years without deterioration from the sun or chemicals. It is designed to fit over the wire bail on buckets, to fit on rope or twine when carrying boxes or packages, to fit over the wire handles on pet cages and live animal traps, and they can even be modified for use on custom made tools and stuff. Your hands will love you!!! Comfortable Have you ever carried a bucket full of tools, paint, water, dirt? Have you ever gone on a trip and had a box or some other type of heavy package wrapped with string or rope? Do you ever have to lift a pet cage or live animal trap with an angry animal in it? If you said yes to any one of these questions, then you know how bad it feels on your hands. This ergonomic handle was designed to fit comfortably in your hand! It can reduce hand fatigue by more than 50% buy distributing the weight over more of the surface area of your fingers, which will reduce the possibilities of arm, back, and shoulder injuries. It will also keep you from damaging the circulation in your hands and fingers. SNaPPY GRiP Ergonomic Handles will actually make whatever your carrying seem much, much lighter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81w3JoGj3mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Snappy Grips","source_asin":"B01JD8G4EA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-538558","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01JD8G4EA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01JD8G4EA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
