window.products.push({"id":538728,"name":"Cotton Celtic Circular Knot Print Tapestry Red / 88 X 106-SD074-07","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1LowDfH7cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ravishing tapestry or tablecloth showcases a gorgeous Celtic knots & wheel of life print design in red shades with a beautiful border on a black background. This tapestry can also be used as a coverlet or bedspread. This tapestry highlights: It is made of 100% cotton light weight handloom handwoven fabric Color fast and machine wash separately in cold water Size: Queen about 106\" x 106\" This unique fresh design would make for excellent personal use tapestry a perfect gift and has multiple uses: A Beach Blanket / Sun Canopy A Picnic Blanket A gorgeous Wall Hanging / Ceiling Cover A beautiful Bedspread or Coverlet A cozy Throw An elegant Tablecloth A Room Divider A Furniture Cover As a Fabric for your creativity Washing instructions: Machine wash it separately in cold water Tumble or hand dry Fine Print: We assure the best quality workmanship and material of our products & are confident you won't have to return but in case of product defect we will refund your money back after deducting for shipping cost. 100% Guaranteed! Since our products are handcrafted, there may be a little variation in size, color and thickness of the product The actual products colors & shades may vary slightly from online picture This tapestry is printed not quilted or woven; it is not designed as a fitted sheet. The tapestry is printed on the front side only. The buyer is liable to pay any customs duty or any similar charges incurred in the buyer's home country. The beauty of handcrafted items is that they are unique & imperfect. Artisans literally make these items by their hands so there may be variations to imperfections in their print and/or weave. As a connoisseur of handicrafts please contact us and we will try our best to remedy the situation. We may have more stock of this item in our inventory, please contact us in case you need some more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1LowDfH7cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"India Arts","source_asin":"B002G9MX5I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-538728","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002G9MX5I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002G9MX5I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
