window.products.push({"id":538967,"name":"Elegant Comfort Reversible 10-Piece Comforter Set, Tie-Dye Print, Decorative Pillow and Fitted Sheet with Smart Pockets, Soft, Plush, Lightweight Mate","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":90.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81v7baTkQbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our new Elegant Comfort 10-Piece Tie-Dye Collection will offer ultimate comfort and style. Soft, cozy, and modern. This Reversible 10-Piece Comforter Set is available in multiple colors to help you coordinate with your interior design. Soft and plush to keep you warm all year round. Firm stitching to prevent filling from shifting and bunching, promising an even layer of warmth. This 10-Piece set includes two styles in one. You can style your bedroom using the Tie-Dye printed side or its solid-colored reverse side. Please note that your 10-Piece Comforter Set will be vacuum sealed. Upon arrival, you will need to open your package and allow up to 24-hours for your comforter and pillows to fully fluff. Our products are OEKO-TEX 100 STANDARD CERTIFIED. Featuring fitted sheets with double-sided storage pockets to keep your bedtime materials within reach. You can store your glasses, books, remote controls, cell phones, etc. Machine wash cold on a delicate cycle. Tumble dry low (or air dry). DO NOT BLEACH.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81v7baTkQbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elegant Comfort","source_asin":"B0BKDDMJYY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-538967","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKDDMJYY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKDDMJYY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":538968,"name":"Banshren® Sacred Geometry Symbols Engraved Natural Amethyst Stone Healing Balancing Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71X6mUSmMeL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Sacred Geometry: Geometric Shapes and their meanings Sacred Geometry is an ancient science that seeks to understand how the universe and creation unifies all things. It is considered the starting point of all form. There is a precise way that Creation organizes itself - every natural pattern of growth or movement can be seen to manifest within one or more geometric shapes. This set includes 7 Crystals faceted into the Sacred Geometric shapes known as the \"Platonic Solids\". The platonic solids are the repeating geometric patterns that are the basic building blocks of life. As we know life is composed of these geometric structures: Our physical bodies, cells, DNA, plants, animals, minerals, planets, galaxies and universes are endlessly repeating these archetypal patterns. These special crystals make an excellent personal energetic enhanced kit and can be used for Chakra Clearing & Balancing, Meditation, Dream work, Ceremony, Energy Grid, Activations, Environmental Space Clearing, and Feng Shui. Included: 1.) Cube 2.) Icosahedron 3.) Tetrahedron 4.) Octahedron 5.) Ball 6.) Merkaba Star 7.) Dodecahedron Sizes: 0.6-0.8 inches each The Platonic solids were known to the ancient Greeks, and were described by Plato in his Timaeus ca. 350 BC. Plato equated the Tetrahedron with the element fire, the Cube with earth, the Icosahedron with water, the Octahedron with air, and the Dodecahedron with the stuff of which the constellations and heavens were made. Merkaba is a term from the Egyptian Mystery School. It is found in many languages including African Zulu, Egyptian and Hebrew. In Hebrew it means both the Throne of God as well as a Chariot that carries the human body and spirit from one place to another. Please note: These are natural materials and will have variations of color, size, texture and shape. Inclusions in crystals are normal and do give the stones character.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71X6mUSmMeL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Banshren","source_asin":"B01GJKKS8S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-538968","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GJKKS8S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GJKKS8S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
